    "show_share": true,
    "description": "In a significant move to enhance Pakistan's public health framework, the Ministry of National Health Services Regulations and Coordination (MoNHRSC) has established a dedicated task force to conduct a strategic review of the country's Global Health Initiatives (GHIs). Dr Sameen Siddiqi and Dr Shifa Habib from AKU's Department of Community Health Sciences are leading this initiative. Both experts bring a wealth of experience in public health systems and policy, setting a solid foundation for this crucial review.",
